# OQ-4 (L §2.3): ref and pref take a qualified id before keys (a.x[k], bal(a.p[k], d)), bind a member's kind or index
# (h in a.heir, k in a.ix): p1 reads ana's keyed place, 1 000.00 PLN less buy's 10.00 on the first of each month
# through 2026-06-01 (L §5.10) = 940.00; p2 counts a.persons (ana, ola) and sums a.w over a.ix (1 + 2); p3 adds ola's
# 10.00. OQ-5 (L §6.1): "A member's items mean what they mean alone: a binding inside a member ranges over that
# member's things, the prelude's kinds included. The joint model's own bindings over a shared kind range over every
# member's things": b.own_total binds over accounts inside ben, ben's wsp alone, 500.00 - 6 x 1.00 = 494.00 PLN, as
# ben alone answers (b.q); the joint model's own sum over accounts holds all three, 940 + 10 + 494 = 1 444.00 (p5);
# b.own_moves counts ben's 12 transfers of 2026 (p6), the joint model's count both members' 24 (p7). The unfulfilled
# registers: each plan's January instance, dated before the cut with no observation (L §8.2).
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "a0802be6ee63085fa0c2bafb2e4f8c89319697bdefed67631e2c4ffe4f53058b"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "b45072e9eb234ee3f170cafa233de7b7341b37c4a40344c5e2f8212b15848f7c"

ask p1: bal(a.konto[a.ana], 2026-06-01)
ask p2: count(h in a.persons on 2026-06-01), sum(a.w[k] for k in a.ix)
ask p3: sum(bal(a.konto[h], 2026-06-01) for h in a.persons on 2026-06-01)
ask p4: b.own_total[2026-06-01] law 2026-06-01
ask p5: sum(bal(x, 2026-06-01) for x in accounts on 2026-06-01)
ask p6: b.own_moves[2026] law 2026-06-01
ask p7: count(true for t in transfers over 2026)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place konto[p in persons]: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
index ix = [k1, k2]
input w[k in ix]: num
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN

move buy[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto[ana] to shop amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  persons + [ana, ola] lives 2000-01-01..
  w[k1] = 1
  w[k2] = 2
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  opening[konto[ana]] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[konto[ola]] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place wsp: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
def own_total[d in days]: money PLN = sum(bal(x, d) for x in accounts on d) at reader
def own_moves[y in years]: int = count(true for t in transfers over y) at reader
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from wsp to shop amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 1.00 PLN
  opening[wsp] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: own_total[2026-06-01] law 2026-06-01
=== expect p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7 b.q
p1: 940.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: a.buy[2026-01]
  cut 2026-01-05
p2: (2, 3)
  cut 2026-01-05
p3: 950.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: a.buy[2026-01]
  cut 2026-01-05
p4: 494.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: b.pay[2026-01]
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-01-05
p5: 1 444.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: a.buy[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: b.pay[2026-01]
  cut 2026-01-05
p6: 12
  unfulfilled: b.pay[2026-01]
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-01-05
p7: 24
  unfulfilled: a.buy[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: b.pay[2026-01]
  cut 2026-01-05
b.q: 494.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-01-05
